.* QUISECAUD: DSPSECAUD, the security auditing values.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 40'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=SAJRN CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SAJRNLIB CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SARCV CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SACTL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SALVL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SALVL2 CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SAENDACN CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SAFRCLVL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SACRTAUD CLASS=VALCL.
:KEYL NAME=DSPKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPSECAUD HELP=HLPSEC KEYL=DSPKEYS TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Security Auditing Values
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATAGRP.Audit journal
:DATAI VAR=SAJRN USAGE=OUTPUT.Journal
:DATAI VAR=SAJRNLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:DATAI VAR=SARCV USAGE=OUTPUT.Current receiver
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAGRP.Security auditing system values
:DATAI VAR=SACTL USAGE=OUTPUT.Auditing control (QAUDCTL)
:DATAI VAR=SALVL USAGE=OUTPUT.Auditing level (QAUDLVL)
:DATAI VAR=SALVL2 USAGE=OUTPUT.Auditing level extension (QAUDLVL2)
:DATAI VAR=SAENDACN USAGE=OUTPUT.Auditing end action (QAUDENDACN)
:DATAI VAR=SAFRCLVL USAGE=OUTPUT.Auditing force level (QAUDFRCLVL)
:DATAI VAR=SACRTAUD USAGE=OUTPUT.Default auditing (QCRTOBJAUD)
:EDATAGRP.
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPSEC.Display Security Auditing Values - Help
:P.This display shows whether security auditing is on: the journal its
entries go to, the receiver attached to it now, and the system values
that say what is audited and what happens when the journal cannot be
written. CHGSECAUD changes them.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
